          "id": "bcabcab1-e212-499a-862c-1cb68d1fb299",
          "name": "Banks List",
          "request": {
            "name": "Banks List",
            "description": {
              "content": "This method retrieves a list of available banks in the system. The list can be filtered based on the **transaction type** and **receiving country** to provide a more refined set of results.\n\n### Filters:\n\n- **Transaction Type**: You can filter the list of banks based on the type of transaction being conducted. The supported transaction types are:\n    \n    1. **Cash**\n        \n    2. **Bank Account**\n        \n    3. **Wallet**\n        \n    4. **Card**",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "remit-api",
                "banks"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "transaction_type",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "(Required) "
                }
              ],
              "variable": []
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "disabled": false,
                "key": "X-Country-Code",
                "value": "<string>",
                "description": ""
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "method": "GET",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{bearerToken}}"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
